  "description": "# SIP2.49: Add 4 Arks to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 4 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- Number of Arks to add: 4\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0x0C939b702524fDaBa4914E905Bcb850182308141`\n2. `0x77e5f42d5cf2d1B9849AE6A5d2D7dC5b774f8290`\n3. `0x47F73542a9b59C2316832775C51cC99E6B468A67`\n4. `0x565a4c04E32fBf001AE36C4fB60584A687Ffa27C`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://www.2.49.com \n",
